### Update trip status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/status?status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{driver_token}}


### Get all shuttle stops (student, authenticated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shuttle-stops
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}

### Get all shuttle time slots (student, authenticated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shuttle-stops/time-slots
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}